r 23's figures: a low A4 8th, C5, Eb5 8ths, a trill with a short 32nd turn, then F5 Eb5. A barline follows at about x=1325. Then bar 24: a slurred rising 16th group (D5 Eb5 F5 G5), F5 F5 8ths, then descending 8ths ending low on Bb4 Bb4. Barline at about x=1675. The last stretch is bar 25: a low Bb4 with a trill mark above, two high staccato notes (G5 Bb5), a slurred Bb5 F5, and two low 8ths. The line ends after those two low notes, followed only by a closing mark (=). Those notes sit well below the F5 before them. That fits bar 25's Bb4 Bb4, not bar 26's F5 F5. Nothing on the line goes past bar 25. Bars 25 and 26 differ only in those last two notes, so the program probably over-counted by one. The line holds bars 19 to 25.","right":false,"insights":"The start was easy: bar 20's 16th and 8th groups and the four trilled half notes are clear landmarks. The end was hard because bars 25 and 26 are identical except for their last two notes (Bb4 vs F5), and the heavy, broken image makes faint barlines hard to see. It would have been easier with clearer barlines at the right edge, or with the line after this one, to confirm that bar 26 starts there."},"ttft_ms":32953,"type":"result","duration_ms":40606,"uuid":"3e0c8102-b537-469b-83aa-dc5bfc161734","ttft_stream_ms":1540,"time_to_request_ms":403,"first_content_frame_ms":1540,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":3751,"cacheReadInputTokens":523,"cacheCreationInputTokens":5722,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.12090859999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2972,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":5722,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
